     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "Managerial ethics is the ethical principles and standards guiding the behavior and decision-making of management to determine what is right for the company. Righteousness is the best answer as righteousness management is management that fulfills its responsibilities and duties appropriate to the expectations, standards, and values of employees, investors, and/or customers."
    }
